The income is $Cy$ dollars:

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}\left(y\,\dfrac{\text{dollars}}{\text{computer}}\right)\left(C\,\text{computers}\right)
\\\\
&=Cy\,\dfrac{\text{dollars}}{\cancel{\text{computer}}}\cdot\,\cancel{\text{computers}}
\\\\
&=Cy\,\text{dollars}
\end{align}$

Similarly, the expenses are $Cx$ dollars.
